error[E0550]: handlers would run while the guard is held
  --> $DIR/event-guarded.nra:12:9
   |
11 |     return state.with<int>(func(value: int) -> int {
   |            -----------------------------------------... the guard is held while this lambda runs
12 |         announce(event, value);
   |         ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ this call emits an event
   |
   = help: commit the change, leave the guard, then emit

For more information about this error, try `neura explain E0550`.
